# Imports: Barrel Only, One Line Per Module

**Barrel paths only** for `@/constants`, `@/hooks`, `@/utils`, `@/assets`, `@/services`, **`shared`**. When Convex is wired, generated API uses `convex/_generated/api`.

- **✅** `import { COLORS } from "@/constants";` — **❌** `@/constants/colors`
- **✅** `import { x } from "shared";` — **❌** `shared/...`

**One import line per module.** Combine imports from the same module on one line.

Source: `docs/import-patterns-guide.md`.
